@startuml admin-product-edit
title Admin product edit, then seen on the storefront
actor Admin
participant "Admin UI\n/admin/" as ADM
participant "Commerce API\n/api/v1" as API
participant "Storefront\n/" as SF
actor Shopper

Admin -> ADM : sign in
ADM -> API : POST /admin/auth/login (X-XSRF-TOKEN, AdminLoginRequest)
API --> ADM : 200 AdminUser + session cookie
ADM -> API : GET /admin/products?…
API --> ADM : 200 AdminProductPage
ADM -> API : GET /admin/products/{productId}
API --> ADM : 200 AdminProduct + ETag
opt a new image
  ADM -> API : POST /admin/media (multipart, X-XSRF-TOKEN)
  API --> ADM : 200 or 201 UploadedImage
end
Admin -> ADM : edit and save
ADM -> API : PUT /admin/products/{productId} (If-Match, X-XSRF-TOKEN, AdminProductInput)
alt the ETag is current
  API --> ADM : 200 AdminProduct + new ETag
else another edit came first
  API --> ADM : 412 Problem PRODUCT_VERSION_CONFLICT
end
Shopper -> SF : open the product
SF -> API : GET /products/{slug}
API --> SF : 200 Product with the edited values
@enduml
